el cover",[486],{"type":50,"text":487,"spans":488,"direction":60},"Every parcel includes £20 free cover as standard. You can increase the value up to £999 for extra peace of mind",[],{"dimensions":490,"alt":491,"copyright":30,"url":492,"id":493,"edit":494},{"width":274,"height":274},"Money icon","switch-to-evri.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},{"title":496,"content":497,"icon":501},"Flexible printing options",[498],{"type":50,"text":499,"spans":500,"direction":60},"Print your postage labels at home or in-store for FREE using our Print in ParcelShop devices",[],{"dimensions":502,"alt":503,"copyright":30,"url":504,"id":505,"edit":506},{"width":274,"height":274},"Printer icon","switch-to-evri.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},{"title":508,"content":509,"icon":513},"Connect your marketplaces",[510],{"type":50,"text":511,"spans":512,"direction":60},"Link your Evri account with popular marketplaces and ecommerce platforms or upload a CSV to book deliveries in one go. We'll even mark your orders as 'dispatched' and update your customers with tracking information",[],{"dimensions":514,"alt":515,"copyright":30,"url":516,"id":517,"edit":518},{"width":274,"height":274},"Laptop icon","switch-to-evri.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},{"title":520,"content":521,"icon":525},"Worldwide delivery",[522],{"type":50,"text":523,"spans":524,"direction":60},"Reach your customers internationally quickly and cheaply. We deliver to 200+ countries and territories from just £6.08",[],{"dimensions":526,"alt":527,"copyright":30,"url":528,"id":529,"edit":530},{"width":274,"height